{
  "description": "Alterations and refurbishment including structural masonry repairs, refurbishment of the Main Hall, improvements to accessibility and circulation including lifts and reconfigured entrances and ramped access, replacement of mechanical and electrical services; new substation, new refuse store, PV panels and associated works (Linked with 25/04920/FULL).\n\nFollowing the approval of Planning Application 25/04920/FULL (05.03.2026) and Listed Building Consent 25/04921/LBC (05.03.2026), this updated Listed Building Consent application seeks approval for amendments to the approved scheme, including revised mechanical and electrical installations that substantially reduce interventions to the existing roof and historic roof structure, replacement windows to the Crypt, external lighting to the building, and associated works.  (Linked with planning application 26/07197/FULL).\n\nPlease refer to cover letter attached to application",
